Cloud Code CLI
==============

This project is derived from kimi-code (https://github.com/MoonshotAI/kimi-code),
Copyright (c) Moonshot AI, licensed under the MIT License.

Cloud Code CLI is a derivative distribution created by copying a subset of the
kimi-code monorepo and rebranding it (package names, CLI binary, environment
variable prefix, and product name). The original MIT license text is retained
in the LICENSE file at the root of this repository.

Kimi, Moonshot, and related model/provider identifiers that remain in the
source (provider type literals, model IDs, API endpoints, `KIMI_API_KEY`)
refer to Moonshot AI's services and are not product names of this project.
